<title>USA: Andersen Worldwide CEO Weinbach partner to leave.</title>
<headline>Andersen Worldwide CEO Weinbach partner to leave.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Andersen Worldwide said Thursday its managing partner and chief executive officer Lawrence Weinbach had decided to leave the firm when his term expires at the end of August.</p>
<p>Weinbach has decided not to stand for election to a third four-year term, the consulting firm said.</p>
<p>A nominating commission elected by the firm's partners will propose candidates to succeed Weinbach, it said. A decision will be made in &quot;several&quot; months, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
